<title>BRAZIL: Brazil Finance Ministry gets $1.0 bln extra credit.</title>
<headline>Brazil Finance Ministry gets $1.0 bln extra credit.</headline>
<dateline>BRASILIA 1996-12-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Brazilian government Saturday published a decree allowing the Finance Ministry to raise an additional non-budgeted 992.55 million reais to pay internal debt, officials said.</p>
<p>Most of the money would be used to pay interest on internal debt, the decree said.</p>
<p>The decree was published in a special edition Saturday of the government's Official Journal.</p>
<p>-- Michael Christie, Brasilia newsroom 55-61-2230358</p>
